---
title: AllocationRun State Machine
---
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Snapshotted : 00:00 VN daily — snapshot eligible orders + stock pool
    Snapshotted --> Planning : run weighted-greedy FEFO planner (no stock held)
    Planning --> AwaitingApproval : plan version produced (batches + shelf-life prices)
    Planning --> Failed : planning error / invalid inputs

    AwaitingApproval --> Approved : Admin approves proposal + final prices (reserves stock)
    AwaitingApproval --> Snapshotted : recalculation requested (re-plan)

    Approved --> Closed : run fully consumed by reservation / picking issue
    Failed --> [*]
    Closed --> [*]
